{"id":"n4-073","title":"Verb + 続ける","romaji":"つづける, tsuzukeru","jlptLevel":4,"shortExplanation":"To continue doing or to keep doing an action.","longExplanation":"The grammar point 続ける (tsuzukeru) is attached to the masu-stem form of verbs, and it indicates the ongoing continuity of an action. It can be translated as 'to continue doing' or 'to keep doing' in English.","formation":"Verb-masu-stem + 続ける","examples":[{"jp":"彼は毎日ジムで運動を続けています。","romaji":"Kare wa mainichi jimu de undou o tsuzuketeimasu.","en":"He continues to exercise at the gym every day.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"毎日","vocabId":"1524720","reading":"まいにち"},{"surface":"ジム","vocabId":"1314270","reading":"じむ"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"運動","vocabId":"1172910","reading":"うんどう"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"続け","vocabId":"1405800","reading":"つづける","baseForm":"続ける"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い","baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[7]},{"jp":"彼女は勉強を続けるために図書館に行きました。","romaji":"Kanojo wa benkyou o tsuzukeru tame ni toshokan ni ikimashita.","en":"She went to the library to continue studying.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"勉強","vocabId":"1512670","reading":"べんきょう"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"続ける","vocabId":"1405800","reading":"つづける"},{"surface":"ため","vocabId":"1157080","reading":"ため"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"図書館","vocabId":"1370420","reading":"としょかん"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行き","vocabId":"1578790","reading":"いき","baseForm":"行く"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4]},{"jp":"私たちは雨にも関わらず散歩を続けました。","romaji":"Watashitachi wa ame ni mo kakawarazu sanpo o tsuzukemashita.","en":"We continued walking despite the rain.","words":[{"surface":"私","vocabId":"1311110","reading":"わたし"},{"surface":"たち","vocabId":"1416220","reading":"たち"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"雨","vocabId":"1171900","reading":"あめ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"関わら","vocabId":"1589880","reading":"かかわる","baseForm":"関わる"},{"surface":"ず","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ぬ"},{"surface":"散歩","vocabId":"1303620","reading":"さんぽ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"続け","vocabId":"1405800","reading":"つづける","baseForm":"続ける"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[10]},{"jp":"彼は仕事を続けることに決めた。","romaji":"Kare wa shigoto o tsuzukeru koto ni kimeta.","en":"He decided to continue working.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"仕事","vocabId":"1304970","reading":"しごと"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"続ける","vocabId":"1405800","reading":"つづける"},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"決め","vocabId":"1630630","reading":"きめ","baseForm":"決める"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4]}]}